{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前，馬斯克在巴倫投資大會上對外披露特斯拉人形機械人Optimus（擎天柱）最新規劃。馬斯克表示，<strong>擎天柱的初期成本可能與電動汽車差不多，每台機械人的初始成本約為3萬美元，之後會降至2萬美元左右，預計將在2027年底左右開始交付，但交付形式可能是「租」而不是「賣」。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585816.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.770506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:37:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"4ae2e3983715ee0e3238868a358ffab563c65a0c8aa6951f2a4fda73467a1650","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}